---
/**
 * Step 9 of the homepage hierarchy: price, stated once the reader knows what
 * they would be buying.
 *
 * Figures are mirrored from src/pages/membership.astro and must stay in sync
 * with it: $200/month individual, family from $175 down to $100 per person,
 * six-month minimum, 30 days' written notice.
 */
---

<section class="pricing section" aria-label="Pricing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pricing-header">
      <span class="section-label">Pricing</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What membership costs</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing-grid">
      <div class="price-card card">
        <h3>Individual</h3>
        <p class="price-figure">$200<span class="price-unit">/month</span></p>
        <p class="price-body">
          One flat monthly fee covering unlimited visits with no copay, same-day and
          next-day appointments, direct phone, text, and email access to your
          physician, preventive and chronic care, minor in-office procedures,
          telehealth, specialist coordination, and Lifestyle Medicine. Labs and
          medications are passed through at wholesale.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="price-card card">
        <h3>Family</h3>
        <p class="price-figure">from $175<span class="price-unit">per person/month</span></p>
        <p class="price-body">
          The per-person rate decreases as the family grows, down to $100 per person
          at five or more members. Children are welcome at every age.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing-terms callout">
      <p>
        <strong>Terms, stated plainly:</strong> membership carries a six-month minimum
        commitment from your enrollment date. After that it's month to month, and
        cancelling takes 30 days' written notice. There is no enrollment fee, no copay,
        and nothing else billed for primary care. Many members can pay with HSA funds
        following the Primary Care Enhancement Act, effective January 1, 2026 &mdash;
        confirm with your plan administrator.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing-ctas">
      <a href="/membership" class="btn btn-primary">See all membership tiers &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule a free meet &amp; greet</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing {
    background: var(--cream-50);
  }
  .pricing-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .price-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .price-figure {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--green-500);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .price-unit {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-500);
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
  }
  .price-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pricing-terms {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
  }
  .pricing-terms p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-700);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pricing-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .pricing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .pricing-ctas .btn { display: block; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
